<title>USA: U.S. Defense Stockpile accepts tin offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Defense Stockpile accepts tin offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center Wednesday awarded American Iron &amp; Metal Co 200 tonnes of tin at a unit price of $2.6572 a pound for a total price of $1,171,612.62.</p>
<p>Tin is offered for sale by the Stockpile on the first Wednesday of every month and bids on the next offer are due on March 5, 1997.</p>
<p>((-New York Commodities Desk, +1-859-1640))</p>
